graph TD
  A[Verification and audit finished] --> B{High-severity<br/>direct leak?}
  B -->|yes| C[Apply findings,<br/>re-run from raw text,<br/>then audit again]
  B -->|no| D{Passages needing<br/>human judgment?}
  D -->|no| G[Gate passes]
  D -->|yes| E[A person reads them]
  E --> F{Acceptable?}
  F -->|no| I[Edit the source,<br/>re-run, then audit again]
  F -->|yes| H[Re-run gate with<br/>--human-reviewed]
  H --> G2[Gate passes]
  class A,C,I local
  class B,D,F neutral
  class E,H,G,G2 human
  classDef local fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#2a78d6,color:#0b0b0b
  classDef provider fill:#fdeee7,stroke:#eb6834,color:#0b0b0b
  classDef human fill:#e5f6f0,stroke:#1baf7a,color:#0b0b0b
  classDef neutral fill:#f4f3f0,stroke:#8a8983,color:#0b0b0b
